@page
@model IndexModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Home page";
}

<div class="text-center">
    <img src="~/images/cava.webp" />
    <h1 class=" THeHeader display-4">
        Bring CAVA to Stillwater, Oklahoma!
    </h1>
    <h2> We believe Stillwater, Oklahoma, would be a great place for CAVA to open its next location, and here are a few reasons why</h2>
</div>

<div class=""> 
<h4>1. A Community That Loves Healthy Food</h4>

<p>
    Stillwater is home to Oklahoma State University, which had 27,655 students on its Stillwater campus in fall 2025. Our community includes thousands of students, student-athletes, and active individuals who enjoy eating healthy.
</p>

<p>
    We believe CAVA would be a great option for people looking for fresh, healthy meals, especially students and athletes who care about their nutrition. CAVA would give our community another convenient option for fresh Mediterranean food.
</p>


<h4>2. A Gap in the Market</h4>

<p>
    Here in Stillwater, we have plenty of restaurants, but not many offer the same type of food as CAVA. There isn't a major Mediterranean fast-casual chain offering customizable, build-your-own bowls in our community.
</p>

<p>
    CAVA is already growing across Oklahoma, and people in the state are becoming familiar with the brand. We believe bringing CAVA to Stillwater would introduce something different to the local restaurant scene and give students and residents a new place to enjoy fresh Mediterranean food.
</p>


<h4>3. A Great Business Opportunity for CAVA</h4>

<p>
    Stillwater has an estimated population of 50,046 residents, along with a large university community. But Stillwater is not just about students. We also have families, working professionals, and thousands of visitors who come to OSU sporting events throughout the year.
</p>

<p>
    For example, Boone Pickens Stadium has a capacity of 52,202 people, showing how many visitors our city can attract during major football games.
</p>

<p>
    We believe CAVA could benefit from both everyday customers, including students and local residents, and the additional visitors who come to Stillwater for sporting events.
</p>


<h4>Why We Want CAVA Here</h4>

<p>
    As students and members of the Stillwater community, we would love to have more healthy food options in town.
</p>

<p>
    With over 27,000 students, around 50,000 residents, limited direct competition, and a strong athletic community, we believe Stillwater has a lot of potential for CAVA.
</p>

<p>
    CAVA is already growing across Oklahoma, so why not Stillwater?
</p>

<p>
    We hope CAVA will consider Stillwater, Oklahoma, as one of its future locations!
</p>

<h2 class="buttomtext"> CAVA to Stillwater!</h2>

</div>

